            <p>Britain stamps German imports as a warning to shoppers.</p>
            <p class="out">Outcome: imports rise, the stamp becomes a mark of quality.<sup><a href="#note-7">7</a>, <a href="#note-8">8</a></sup></p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="yr">1923</p>
            <p class="tag">The door closes</p>
            <p>After 38 years of head tax, Canada bars Chinese immigration outright.</p>
            <p class="out">Outcome: repealed 1947, full apology in the House of Commons 2006.<sup><a href="#note-10">10</a>, <a href="#note-11">11</a></sup></p>
          </li>
